    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "c1033df0-d414-42d5-9521-7b46cdd913ca",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Downfall of COB",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHAMERICA",
        "PublicId": "122021496514",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 90505cde-9b68-488f-827b-ff81498264aa).Image",
        "Description": "COB, The cult of blood. Today all cult members have gathered to create a bbq. But this bbq has human meat. Eliminate all cult leaders.\rCharles Blake III - The Director, Runs the show. [Has a bodyguard cultist]\rRichard Wilson - The Cook, Creates the human meat food.\rSusan Wilson - The Icon, Lures in people to kill, Invites others to join the cult.\rLance Brown Hanson - The Killer,  Kills people for the meat. [Armed]\rDale Anderson - The Distributer, Moves the &quot;Products&quot;. Packages meat.\rGood luck 47",
